# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit the real values.
# Set the same values in the host's environment variables (Vercel: Project
# Settings > Environment Variables).
#
# DECK_KEY unlocks the sealed deck in deck/sealed and signs readers' passes.
# `npm run deck:seal -- path/to/deck.pdf` generates one into .env.local if it
# is missing. Without it /deck answers "unavailable".
DECK_KEY=

# Deck visits and "Join the YOOJ network" sign-ups go to two Google Forms
# (linked to their spreadsheets). They need no variables here: which forms,
# and which questions, is in integrations/google-forms/forms.json.
